; Copy to .smoke.env in the project root (git-ignored) and fill in. Read-only calls only.
; Quote the values: base64 secrets and tokens end in "=", which INI does not allow unquoted.
; NAME=value, split at the first "=", quotes optional.
; Leave key/secret or token empty to skip that auth method.
MYRA_KEY=""
MYRA_SECRET=""
MYRA_TOKEN=""
; a domain (zone) of the account, e.g. example.com
MYRA_DOMAIN=""
